<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96717" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στηλ-όω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στᾱλόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set up as a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στήλη</span> or <i>monument</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτρον στάλωσε ἐπ᾽ ἠρίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.394
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφον</span> Epigr. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				662.28
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Amyntas</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωρὸν λίθων ἐπί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ki.</u>
					18.17
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be so set up, stand firm</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Jd.</u>
				18.16
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στηλοῦσθαί τινι</span>
			<i>devote oneself to</i> another, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>inscribe on a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στήλη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				221.15
			</span></i> (Ilium, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>):—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Milet.</u>
				6.36
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Didyma</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>mark out with boundary pillars</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν χώραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					225.30
				</span></i>
			 (Didyma, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				335.74
			</span></i> (Pergam., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>).</div>
